msgstr "ISO-tydźeń (tydźeń 1 wobsahuje prěni štwórtk)"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18595
msgid "Week numbering"
msgstr "Čisłowanje tydźenjow"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18597
msgid "Celsius (°C)"
msgstr "Celsius (°C)"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18597
msgid "Fahrenheit (°F)"
msgstr "Fahrenheit (°F)"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18599
msgid "Weather temperature"
msgstr "Wjedrowa temperatura"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18604
msgid "Time zone"
msgstr "Časowe pasmo"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18616
msgid ""
"Restart the Organizer after saving so that language, time zone, and all "
"native windows use the new choices."
msgstr ""
"Startujće Organizer po składowanju znowa, zo by rěč, časowe pasmo a wšě "
"systemowe wokna nowe nastajenja wužiwali."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18622
msgid "Country and region"
msgstr "Kraj a region"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18623
msgid ""
"Public holidays and school holidays are governed regionally. Choose which "
"ones apply here."
msgstr ""
"Zjawne swjate dny a šulske prózdniny su regionalnje rjadowane. Wubjerće, "
"kotrež tu płaća."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18627
msgid "— not specified —"
msgstr "— njepodate —"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18640
msgid "— please select —"
msgstr "— prošu wubrać —"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18649
msgid "All cantons"
msgstr "Wšě kantony"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18649
msgid "All states"
msgstr "Wšě zwjazkowe kraje"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18670
msgid "Canton"
msgstr "Kanton"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18670
msgid "State"
msgstr "Zwjazkowy kraj"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18673
msgid ""
"No regional data is retrieved without a selected canton. With “All”, each "
"entry shows its canton and matching periods are combined."
msgstr ""
"Bjez wubraneho kantona so regionalne daty njewotwołuja. Z „Wšě“ pokazuje "
"kóždy zapisk swój kanton a samsne doby so zjednoća."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18675
msgid ""
"No regional data is retrieved without a selected state. With “All”, each "
"entry shows its state and matching periods are combined."
msgstr ""
"Bjez wubraneho zwjazkoweho kraja so regionalne daty njewotwołuja. Z „Wšě“ "
"pokazuje kóždy zapisk swój zwjazkowy kraj a samsne doby so zjednoća."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18695
msgid "Retrieve public holidays and school holidays"
msgstr "Zjawne swjate dny a šulske prózdniny wotwołać"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18696
msgid ""
"The information is retrieved once from the open directory openholidaysapi."
"org and then kept in the organizer. The application therefore needs an "
"internet connection only once."
msgstr ""
"Informacije so jónu z wotewrjeneho zapisa openholidaysapi.org wotwołaja a "
"potom w organizatorje wobchowaja. Nałoženje tuž internetny zwisk jenož jónu "
"trjeba."

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18701
msgid "only %(year)s"
msgstr "jenož %(year)s"

#: app/web/anwendung.js:18702
